# Spider-Woman, Stunning Savior's Venom Blast: "Artifacts and creatures your opponents control enter tapped". A
# replacement effect that looks at what enters judges it as it would exist on the battlefield (CR 614.12): a card
# manifested face down is a 2/2 creature there (CR 701.40a, 708.2), whatever the card itself is.
#
# Turn 1: Bot1 Wheels off a Black Lotus and casts Abhorrent Oculus by exiling six graveyard cards. Turn 2, Bot2's
# upkeep: the Oculus manifests dread, Guerrilla Gorilla goes face down (Spider-Woman is not out yet), and Bot2 then casts
# Spider-Woman. Turn 4, Bot2's upkeep: the Oculus manifests dread again and Bot1 puts Ponder - a sorcery card -
# onto the battlefield face down. That face-down 2/2 is a creature an opponent of Spider-Woman's controller controls,
# so it enters tapped, while the first face-down creature, untapped in Bot1's turn-3 untap step, stays untapped.

